{"number":102,"nameArabic":"التكاثر","nameTransliterated":"At-Takathur","nameTranslated":"The Rivalry in world increase","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":8,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"102:1","textAr":"أَلۡهَىٰكُمُ ٱلتَّكَاثُرُ","transliteration":"Alhakumu alttakathuru","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Competition in [worldly] increase diverts you"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تم لوگوں کو زیادہ سے زیادہ اور ایک دوسرے سے بڑھ کر دنیا حاصل کرنے کی دھن نے غفلت میں ڈال رکھا ہے"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"102:2","textAr":"حَتَّىٰ زُرۡتُمُ ٱلۡمَقَابِرَ","transliteration":"Hatta zurtumu almaqabira","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Until you visit the graveyards"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یہاں تک کہ (اسی فکر میں) تم لب گور تک پہنچ جاتے ہو"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"102:3","textAr":"كَلَّا سَوۡفَ تَعۡلَمُونَ","transliteration":"Kalla sawfa taAAlamoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"No! You are going to know"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہرگز نہیں، عنقریب تم کو معلوم ہو جائے گا"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"102:4","textAr":"ثُمَّ كَلَّا سَوۡفَ تَعۡلَمُونَ","transliteration":"Thumma kalla sawfa taAAlamoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then no! You are going to know"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر (سن لو کہ) ہرگز نہیں، عنقریب تم کو معلوم ہو جائے گا"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"102:5","textAr":"كَلَّا لَوۡ تَعۡلَمُونَ عِلۡمَ ٱلۡيَقِينِ","transliteration":"Kalla law taAAlamoona AAilma alyaqeeni","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"No! If you only knew with knowledge of certainty"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہرگز نہیں، اگر تم یقینی علم کی حیثیت سے (اِس روش کے انجام کو) جانتے ہوتے (تو تمہارا یہ طرز عمل نہ ہوتا)"}]},{"ayah":6,"verseKey":"102:6","textAr":"لَتَرَوُنَّ ٱلۡجَحِيمَ","transliteration":"Latarawunna aljaheema","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"You will surely see the Hellfire"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تم دوزخ دیکھ کر رہو گے"}]},{"ayah":7,"verseKey":"102:7","textAr":"ثُمَّ لَتَرَوُنَّهَا عَيۡنَ ٱلۡيَقِينِ","transliteration":"Thumma latarawunnaha AAayna alyaqeeni","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then you will surely see it with the eye of certainty"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر (سن لو کہ) تم بالکل یقین کے ساتھ اُسے دیکھ لو گے"}]},{"ayah":8,"verseKey":"102:8","textAr":"ثُمَّ لَتُسۡـَٔلُنَّ يَوۡمَئِذٍ عَنِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","transliteration":"Thumma latusalunna yawmaithin AAani alnnaAAeemi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then you will surely be asked that Day about pleasure"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر ضرور اُس روز تم سے اِن نعمتوں کے بارے میں جواب طلبی کی جائے گی"}]}]}